  tetrahedral   |sum_j Y_l| l=0..2 (components) 4.0000 0.0000 0.0000 | l=0..4 (Legendre) 4.0000 0.0000 0.0000 7.8881 6.1101
  square planar |sum_j Y_l| l=0..2 (components) 4.0000 0.0000 4.4721 | l=0..4 (Legendre) 4.0000 0.0000 4.4721 0.0000 9.9499
  l_max = 1 cannot separate them (no dipole: l=1 vanishes for both); l = 2 vanishes only for the tetrahedron, l = 3 only for the square
